---
layout: null
permalink: /events.ics
---
{%- comment -%}
The subscribable calendar feed (RFC 5545), built from _data/events.yml.

Two things about this file are load-bearing and easy to break:

  1. It is stored with CRLF line endings, because the spec requires them and
     Liquid has no way to emit a \r. The .gitattributes entry pins that, so
     editors and git stay out of it. Whitespace control is applied on nearly
     every tag below, so no stray blank lines land in the output.
  2. Text fields are escaped for iCalendar, not for HTML: backslash first, then
     semicolon and comma. Getting that order wrong double-escapes everything.

Times in the data file are local Philly time, written out with TZID against the
VTIMEZONE block below, so subscribers see 6PM wherever they are.
{%- endcomment -%}
BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//Drink20 Philly//Events//EN
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
METHOD:PUBLISH
NAME:{{ site.title }} Events
X-WR-CALNAME:{{ site.title }} Events
DESCRIPTION:Tabletop game nights at breweries around Philadelphia.
X-WR-CALDESC:Tabletop game nights at breweries around Philadelphia.
X-WR-TIMEZONE:America/New_York
SOURCE;VALUE=URI:{{ page.url | prepend: site.url }}
REFRESH-INTERVAL;VALUE=DURATION:PT12H
X-PUBLISHED-TTL:PT12H
BEGIN:VTIMEZONE
TZID:America/New_York
BEGIN:DAYLIGHT
TZOFFSETFROM:-0500
TZOFFSETTO:-0400
TZNAME:EDT
DTSTART:19700308T020000
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY;BYMONTH=3;BYDAY=2SU
END:DAYLIGHT
BEGIN:STANDARD
TZOFFSETFROM:-0400
TZOFFSETTO:-0500
TZNAME:EST
DTSTART:19701101T020000
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY;BYMONTH=11;BYDAY=1SU
END:STANDARD
END:VTIMEZONE
{% for event in site.data.events -%}
{%- assign day = event.date | date: "%Y%m%d" -%}
{%- assign from = event.start | replace: ":", "" | append: "00" -%}
{%- assign to = event.end | replace: ":", "" | append: "00" -%}
{%- assign summary = event.title | strip_newlines | replace: "\", "\\" | replace: ";", "\;" | replace: ",", "\," -%}
{%- assign place = event.location | strip_newlines | replace: "\", "\\" | replace: ";", "\;" | replace: ",", "\," -%}
{%- assign details = event.details | strip_newlines | replace: "\", "\\" | replace: ";", "\;" | replace: ",", "\," -%}
BEGIN:VEVENT
{% comment -%}
The UID has to outlive edits. A calendar client keys on it, so a changed UID
is not an edit to a subscriber — the old event is dropped and a new one
appears. That rules out building it from anything correctable, and this used
to carry the title and the start time, so fixing either churned the event for
everyone subscribed.

What is left is the date and which event that day it is, counted in file
order. Two games on one night are rare, and the issue form appends within a
date rather than ahead of what is there, so an existing event keeps its
number when another is added alongside it.

Changing an event's date does still change its UID, which is the one case
where dropping and re-adding is the honest result: nothing is happening on
the old date any more.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign pos = forloop.index0 -%}
{%- assign seq = 1 -%}
{%- for prior in site.data.events limit: pos -%}
{%- assign prior_day = prior.date | date: "%Y%m%d" -%}
{%- if prior_day == day -%}{%- assign seq = seq | plus: 1 -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{% capture line %}UID:{{ day }}-{{ seq }}@drink20.com{% endcapture -%}
{% include ics-fold.html text=line %}
DTSTAMP:{{ site.time | date: "%Y%m%dT%H%M%SZ" }}
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:{{ day }}T{{ from }}
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:{{ day }}T{{ to }}
{% capture line %}SUMMARY:{{ summary }}{% endcapture -%}
{% include ics-fold.html text=line %}
{% if event.location -%}
{%- capture line %}LOCATION:{{ place }}{% endcapture -%}
{% include ics-fold.html text=line %}
{% endif -%}
{%- if event.link -%}
{%- capture line %}URL;VALUE=URI:{{ event.link }}{% endcapture -%}
{% include ics-fold.html text=line %}
{% endif -%}
{%- comment -%}
DESCRIPTION carries the Facebook link as text too — most mobile calendar apps
show the notes field but bury or drop the URL property.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture line -%}
DESCRIPTION:{%- if event.details %}{{ details }}\n\n{% endif -%}{%- if event.link %}Facebook event: {{ event.link }}\n\n{% endif -%}More at {{ site.url }}/events
{%- endcapture -%}
{% include ics-fold.html text=line %}
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
{% endfor -%}
END:VCALENDAR
